HireShield AI uses FastAPI, Uvicorn (BSD-3-Clause), pypdf (BSD-3-Clause) and ReportLab (BSD-3-Clause); optional components are pytest/httpx (tests), yara-python (Apache-2.0) and python-dotenv. Their licenses and upstream notices are retained by their respective distributions. No code from QuickSand, YARA, or ClamAV is bundled. Optional ClamAV integration invokes the installed clamscan executable.
